+  <div class="sidebar-bottom"><div class="tip-card"><span class="tip-spark">✳</span><strong>Make room for focus.</strong><p>A little progress, every day.</p></div><button class="profile"><span class="avatar">Y</span><span class="profile-name"><strong>Your space</strong><small>Personal plan</small></span><span class="profile-more">···</span></button></div>
